{"1-5":{"people":[{"id":"jesus-g2424g","name":"Jesus","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Joseph","count":1,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"theophilus-g2321","name":"Theophilus","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"john-g2491g","name":"John","kind":"person","brief":"A prophet","count":1,"firstVerse":5}],"places":[{"id":"jerusalem-h3389","name":"Jerusalem","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":4}],"words":[{"base":"G2250","lemma":"ἡμέρα","tr":"hēmera","gloss":"day","lang":"g","inPassage":3,"uses":389},{"base":"G0907","lemma":"βαπτίζω","tr":"baptizō","gloss":"to baptize","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":76},{"base":"G3303","lemma":"μέν","tr":"men","gloss":"on the other hand","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":178},{"base":"G0040","lemma":"ἅγιος","tr":"hagios","gloss":"holy","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":222},{"base":"G4012","lemma":"περί","tr":"peri","gloss":"about","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":332},{"base":"G2321","lemma":"Θεόφιλος","tr":"Theophilos","gloss":"Theophilus","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":2},{"base":"G4183","lemma":"πολύς","tr":"polus","gloss":"much","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":367},{"base":"G4151","lemma":"πνεῦμα","tr":"pneuma","gloss":"spirit","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":379},{"base":"G3326","lemma":"μετά","tr":"meta","gloss":"with","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":465},{"base":"G4160","lemma":"ποιέω","tr":"poieō","gloss":"to do","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":569}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"LUK","chapter":24,"verse":49,"verseEnd":49,"votes":35,"source":"both","text":"And behold, I am sending the promise of My Father upon you. But remain in the city until you have been clothed with power from on high.”","from":4},{"book":"LUK","chapter":1,"verse":3,"verseEnd":3,"votes":29,"source":"both","text":"Therefore, having carefully investigated everything from the beginning, it seemed good also to me to write an orderly account for you, most excellent Theophilus,","from":1},{"book":"JHN","chapter":14,"verse":16,"verseEnd":16,"votes":21,"source":"both","text":"And I will ask the Father, and He will give you another Advocate to be with you forever—","from":4},{"book":"MAT","chapter":3,"verse":11,"verseEnd":11,"votes":20,"source":"both","text":"I baptize you with water for repentance, but after me will come One more powerful than I, whose sandals I am not worthy to carry. He will baptize you with the Holy Spirit and with fire.","from":5},{"book":"1CO","chapter":15,"verse":5,"verseEnd":5,"votes":17,"source":"openbible","text":"and that He appeared to Cephas and then to the Twelve.","from":3},{"book":"1CO","chapter":15,"verse":7,"verseEnd":7,"votes":17,"source":"openbible","text":"Then He appeared to James, then to all the apostles.","from":3},{"book":"JHN","chapter":15,"verse":26,"verseEnd":26,"votes":15,"source":"both","text":"When the Advocate comes, whom I will send to you from the Father—the Spirit of truth who proceeds from the Father—He will testify about Me.","from":4},{"book":"ACT","chapter":11,"verse":15,"verseEnd":15,"votes":15,"source":"both","text":"As I began to speak, the Holy Spirit fell upon them, just as He had fallen upon us at the beginning.","from":5}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"paul-circle","title":"Paul's Circle","people":2},{"id":"herod-family","title":"The Herods","people":2},{"id":"john-baptist-circle","title":"John the Baptist's Circle","people":2},{"id":"jesus-family","title":"Jesus and His Family Circle","people":2}]},"6-8":{"people":[{"id":"israel-h3478","name":"Israel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isaac","count":1,"firstVerse":6}],"places":[{"id":"jerusalem-h3389","name":"Jerusalem","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":8},{"id":"judea-h3063n","name":"Judea","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":8},{"id":"samaria-h8111","name":"Samaria","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":8}],"words":[{"base":"G5550","lemma":"χρόνος","tr":"chronos","gloss":"time","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":54},{"base":"G0600","lemma":"ἀποκαθίστημι","tr":"apokathistēmi","gloss":"to restore","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":8},{"base":"G1904","lemma":"ἐπέρχομαι","tr":"eperchomai","gloss":"to arrive","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":9},{"base":"G4540","lemma":"Σαμάρεια","tr":"Samareia","gloss":"Samaria","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":11},{"base":"G4905","lemma":"συνέρχομαι","tr":"sunerchomai","gloss":"to assemble","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":30},{"base":"G3144","lemma":"μάρτυς","tr":"martus","gloss":"witness","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":35},{"base":"G2449","lemma":"Ἰουδαία","tr":"Ioudaia","gloss":"Judea","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":44},{"base":"G2078","lemma":"ἔσχατος","tr":"eschatos","gloss":"last","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":52},{"base":"G2065","lemma":"ἐρωτάω","tr":"erōtaō","gloss":"to ask","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":62},{"base":"G2474","lemma":"Ἰσραήλ","tr":"Israēl","gloss":"Israel","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":68}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"MAT","chapter":28,"verse":19,"verseEnd":19,"votes":114,"source":"both","text":"Therefore go and make disciples of all nations, baptizing them in the name of the Father, and of the Son, and of the Holy Spirit,","from":8},{"book":"MRK","chapter":16,"verse":15,"verseEnd":15,"votes":105,"source":"both","text":"And He said to them, “Go into all the world and preach the gospel to every creature.","from":8},{"book":"ROM","chapter":15,"verse":19,"verseEnd":19,"votes":97,"source":"both","text":"by the power of signs and wonders, and by the power of the Spirit of God. So from Jerusalem all the way around to Illyricum, I have fully proclaimed the gospel of Christ.","from":8},{"book":"ACT","chapter":5,"verse":32,"verseEnd":32,"votes":77,"source":"both","text":"We are witnesses of these things, and so is the Holy Spirit, whom God has given to those who obey Him.”","from":8},{"book":"ACT","chapter":4,"verse":33,"verseEnd":33,"votes":75,"source":"both","text":"With great power the apostles continued to give their testimony about the resurrection of the Lord Jesus. And abundant grace was upon them all.","from":8},{"book":"ACT","chapter":6,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":65,"source":"both","text":"Now Stephen, who was full of grace and power, was performing great wonders and signs among the people.","from":8},{"book":"LUK","chapter":24,"verse":46,"verseEnd":46,"votes":63,"source":"openbible","text":"And He told them, “This is what is written: The Christ will suffer and rise from the dead on the third day,","from":8},{"book":"LUK","chapter":24,"verse":49,"verseEnd":49,"votes":63,"source":"openbible","text":"And behold, I am sending the promise of My Father upon you. But remain in the city until you have been clothed with power from on high.”","from":8}],"notes":[],"groups":[]},"9-11":{"people":[{"id":"jesus-g2424g","name":"Jesus","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Joseph","count":1,"firstVerse":11}],"places":[{"id":"galilee-h1551","name":"Galilee","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":11}],"words":[{"base":"G3772","lemma":"οὐρανός","tr":"ouranos","gloss":"heaven","lang":"g","inPassage":4,"uses":272},{"base":"G4198","lemma":"πορεύω","tr":"poreuō","gloss":"to travel","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":147},{"base":"G0435","lemma":"ἀνήρ","tr":"anēr","gloss":"man","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":216},{"base":"G5274","lemma":"ὑπολαμβάνω","tr":"hupolambanō","gloss":"to take up","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":5},{"base":"G0575","lemma":"ἀπό","tr":"apo","gloss":"away from","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":644},{"base":"G2066","lemma":"ἐσθής","tr":"esthēs","gloss":"clothing","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":8},{"base":"G1057","lemma":"Γαλιλαῖος","tr":"Galilaios","gloss":"Galilean","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":11},{"base":"G0353","lemma":"ἀναλαμβάνω","tr":"analambanō","gloss":"to take up","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":12},{"base":"G1689","lemma":"ἐμβλέπω","tr":"emblepō","gloss":"to look into","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":12},{"base":"G5158","lemma":"τρόπος","tr":"tropos","gloss":"way","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":13}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"REV","chapter":1,"verse":7,"verseEnd":7,"votes":26,"source":"both","text":"Behold, He is coming with the clouds, and every eye will see Him—even those who pierced Him. And all the tribes of the earth will mourn because of Him. So shall it be! Amen.","from":11},{"book":"1TH","chapter":4,"verse":16,"verseEnd":16,"votes":23,"source":"both","text":"For the Lord Himself will descend from heaven with a loud command, with the voice of an archangel, and with the trumpet of God, and the dead in Christ will be the first to rise.","from":11},{"book":"MRK","chapter":13,"verse":26,"verseEnd":26,"votes":21,"source":"both","text":"At that time they will see the Son of Man coming in the clouds with great power and glory.","from":11},{"book":"JHN","chapter":14,"verse":3,"verseEnd":3,"votes":17,"source":"both","text":"And if I go and prepare a place for you, I will come back and welcome you into My presence, so that you also may be where I am.","from":11},{"book":"MAT","chapter":24,"verse":30,"verseEnd":30,"votes":15,"source":"both","text":"At that time the sign of the Son of Man will appear in heaven, and all the tribes of the earth will mourn. They will see the Son of Man coming on the clouds of heaven, with power and great glory.","from":11},{"book":"MAT","chapter":25,"verse":31,"verseEnd":31,"votes":15,"source":"both","text":"When the Son of Man comes in His glory, and all the angels with Him, He will sit on His glorious throne.","from":11},{"book":"MAT","chapter":16,"verse":27,"verseEnd":27,"votes":13,"source":"openbible","text":"For the Son of Man will come in His Fatherʼs glory with His angels, and then He will repay each one according to what he has done.","from":11},{"book":"DAN","chapter":7,"verse":13,"verseEnd":13,"votes":12,"source":"both","text":"In my vision in the night I continued to watch, and I saw One like the Son of Man coming with the clouds of heaven. He approached the Ancient of Days and was led into His presence.","from":9}],"notes":[{"id":"zech-14-day-lord","title":"The day the LORD comes and his feet stand on the Mount of Olives","kind":"prophecy"}],"groups":[]},"12-14":{"people":[{"id":"alphaeus-g0256","name":"Alphaeus","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Jacob","count":1,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"andrew-g0406","name":"Andrew","kind":"person","brief":"An apostle","count":1,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"bartholomew-g0918","name":"Bartholomew","kind":"person","brief":"An apostle","count":1,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"james-g2385g","name":"James","kind":"person","brief":"An apostle","count":1,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"james-g2385h","name":"James","kind":"person","brief":"An apostle","count":1,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"james-g2385j","name":"James","kind":"person","brief":"Father of Judas","count":1,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"john-g2491h","name":"John","kind":"person","brief":"An apostle","count":1,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"judas-g2455g","name":"Judas","kind":"person","brief":"An apostle","count":1,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"matthew-g3156","name":"Matthew","kind":"person","brief":"An apostle","count":1,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"peter-g4074g","name":"Peter","kind":"person","brief":"An apostle","count":1,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"philip-g5376g","name":"Philip","kind":"person","brief":"An apostle","count":1,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"simon-g4613g","name":"Simon","kind":"person","brief":"An apostle","count":1,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"thomas-g2381","name":"Thomas","kind":"person","brief":"An apostle","count":1,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"jesus-g2424g","name":"Jesus","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Joseph","count":1,"firstVerse":14},{"id":"mary-g3137g","name":"Mary","kind":"person","brief":"Mosther of Jesus","count":1,"firstVerse":14}],"places":[{"id":"jerusalem-h3389","name":"Jerusalem","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":12},{"id":"olives-mount-h2132g","name":"Olives Mount","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":12}],"words":[{"base":"G2385","lemma":"Ἰάκωβος","tr":"Iakōbos","gloss":"James","lang":"g","inPassage":3,"uses":42},{"base":"G2419","lemma":"Ἱερουσαλήμ","tr":"Hierousalēm","gloss":"Jerusalem","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":77},{"base":"G2208","lemma":"ζηλωτής","tr":"zēlōtēs","gloss":"Zealot","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":2},{"base":"G0918","lemma":"Βαρθολομαῖος","tr":"Bartholomaios","gloss":"Bartholomew","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":4},{"base":"G5253","lemma":"ὑπερῷον","tr":"huperōon","gloss":"upper room","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":4},{"base":"G0256","lemma":"Ἀλφαῖος","tr":"Alphaios","gloss":"Alphaeus","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":5},{"base":"G3156","lemma":"Ματθαῖος","tr":"Matthaios","gloss":"Matthew","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":5},{"base":"G4342","lemma":"προσκαρτερέω","tr":"proskartereō","gloss":"to continue in","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":10},{"base":"G1638","lemma":"ἐλαιών","tr":"elaiōn","gloss":"Olivet","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":11},{"base":"G2381","lemma":"Θωμᾶς","tr":"Thōmas","gloss":"Thomas","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":11}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"ACT","chapter":6,"verse":4,"verseEnd":4,"votes":15,"source":"both","text":"and will devote ourselves to prayer and to the ministry of the word.”","from":14},{"book":"EPH","chapter":6,"verse":18,"verseEnd":18,"votes":15,"source":"both","text":"Pray in the Spirit at all times, with every kind of prayer and petition. To this end, stay alert with all perseverance in your prayers for all the saints.","from":14},{"book":"ACT","chapter":2,"verse":42,"verseEnd":42,"votes":11,"source":"both","text":"They devoted themselves to the apostlesʼ teaching and to the fellowship, to the breaking of bread and to prayer.","from":14},{"book":"COL","chapter":4,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":11,"source":"openbible","text":"Devote yourselves to prayer, being watchful and thankful,","from":14},{"book":"ROM","chapter":12,"verse":12,"verseEnd":12,"votes":10,"source":"openbible","text":"Be joyful in hope, patient in affliction, persistent in prayer.","from":14},{"book":"MAT","chapter":18,"verse":19,"verseEnd":19,"votes":9,"source":"openbible","text":"Again, I tell you truly that if two of you on the earth agree about anything you ask for, it will be done for you by My Father in heaven.","from":14},{"book":"MAT","chapter":18,"verse":20,"verseEnd":20,"votes":9,"source":"openbible","text":"For where two or three gather together in My name, there am I with them.”","from":14},{"book":"LUK","chapter":18,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":9,"source":"both","text":"Then Jesus told them a parable about their need to pray at all times and not lose heart:","from":14}],"notes":[{"id":"zech-14-day-lord","title":"The day the LORD comes and his feet stand on the Mount of Olives","kind":"prophecy"}],"groups":[{"id":"the-twelve","title":"The Twelve Apostles","people":11},{"id":"john-baptist-circle","title":"John the Baptist's Circle","people":7},{"id":"bethany-and-friends","title":"Bethany and the Women Around Jesus","people":7},{"id":"jerusalem-church","title":"The Jerusalem Church","people":7},{"id":"herod-family","title":"The Herods","people":3},{"id":"high-priestly-family","title":"The High-Priestly Family","people":3},{"id":"jesus-family","title":"Jesus and His Family Circle","people":3},{"id":"paul-circle","title":"Paul's Circle","people":2},{"id":"roman-officials","title":"Roman Officials","people":2}]},"15-22":{"people":[{"id":"peter-g4074g","name":"Peter","kind":"person","brief":"An apostle","count":1,"firstVerse":15},{"id":"jesus-g2424g","name":"Jesus","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Joseph","count":2,"firstVerse":16},{"id":"david-h1732","name":"David","kind":"person","brief":"King of Judah","count":1,"firstVerse":16},{"id":"judas-g2455h","name":"Judas","kind":"person","brief":"An apostle","count":1,"firstVerse":16},{"id":"john-g2491g","name":"John","kind":"person","brief":"A prophet","count":1,"firstVerse":22}],"places":[{"id":"akeldama-g0184","name":"Akeldama","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":19},{"id":"jerusalem-h3389","name":"Jerusalem","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":19}],"words":[{"base":"G5564","lemma":"χωρίον","tr":"chōrion","gloss":"place","lang":"g","inPassage":3,"uses":10},{"base":"G1096","lemma":"γίνομαι","tr":"ginomai","gloss":"to be","lang":"g","inPassage":5,"uses":668},{"base":"G2730","lemma":"κατοικέω","tr":"katoikeō","gloss":"to dwell","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":44},{"base":"G3319","lemma":"μέσος","tr":"mesos","gloss":"midst","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":56},{"base":"G1163","lemma":"δεῖ","tr":"dei","gloss":"be necessary","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":101},{"base":"G0435","lemma":"ἀνήρ","tr":"anēr","gloss":"man","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":216},{"base":"G0080","lemma":"ἀδελφός","tr":"adelphos","gloss":"brother","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":343},{"base":"G2250","lemma":"ἡμέρα","tr":"hēmera","gloss":"day","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":389},{"base":"G1984","lemma":"ἐπισκοπή","tr":"episkopē","gloss":"oversight","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":4},{"base":"G2975","lemma":"λαγχάνω","tr":"lagchanō","gloss":"to choose by lot","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":4}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"PSA","chapter":41,"verse":9,"verseEnd":9,"votes":108,"source":"both","text":"Even my close friend whom I trusted, the one who shared my bread, has lifted up his heel against me.","from":16},{"book":"PSA","chapter":69,"verse":25,"verseEnd":25,"votes":56,"source":"both","text":"May their place be deserted; let there be no one to dwell in their tents.","from":20},{"book":"PSA","chapter":109,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":50,"source":"both","text":"May his days be few; may another take his position.","from":20},{"book":"PSA","chapter":109,"verse":15,"verseEnd":15,"votes":50,"source":"openbible","text":"May their sins always remain before the LORD, that He may cut off their memory from the earth.","from":20},{"book":"JHN","chapter":13,"verse":18,"verseEnd":18,"votes":50,"source":"openbible","text":"I am not speaking about all of you; I know whom I have chosen. But this is to fulfill the Scripture: ‘The one who shares My bread has lifted up his heel against Me.’","from":16},{"book":"PSA","chapter":55,"verse":12,"verseEnd":12,"votes":43,"source":"openbible","text":"For it is not an enemy who insults me; that I could endure. It is not a foe who rises against me; from him I could hide.","from":16},{"book":"PSA","chapter":55,"verse":15,"verseEnd":15,"votes":43,"source":"openbible","text":"Let death seize them by surprise; let them go down to Sheol alive, for evil is with them in their homes.","from":16},{"book":"MAT","chapter":27,"verse":3,"verseEnd":3,"votes":9,"source":"openbible","text":"When Judas, who had betrayed Him, saw that Jesus was condemned, he was filled with remorse and returned the thirty pieces of silver to the chief priests and elders.","from":18}],"notes":[{"id":"acts-1-20-judas","title":"Let another take his office","kind":"prophecy"}],"groups":[{"id":"herod-family","title":"The Herods","people":3},{"id":"john-baptist-circle","title":"John the Baptist's Circle","people":3},{"id":"royal-line","title":"The royal line: Judah to David to Jesus","people":2},{"id":"paul-circle","title":"Paul's Circle","people":2},{"id":"jerusalem-church","title":"The Jerusalem Church","people":2},{"id":"high-priestly-family","title":"The High-Priestly Family","people":2},{"id":"roman-officials","title":"Roman Officials","people":2},{"id":"the-twelve","title":"The Twelve Apostles","people":2},{"id":"jesus-family","title":"Jesus and His Family Circle","people":2}]},"23-26":{"people":[{"id":"matthias-g3159","name":"Matthias","kind":"person","brief":"","count":2,"firstVerse":23},{"id":"joseph-g2501m","name":"Joseph","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":23},{"id":"judas-g2455h","name":"Judas","kind":"person","brief":"An apostle","count":1,"firstVerse":25}],"places":[],"words":[{"base":"G3159","lemma":"Ματθίας, Μαθθίας","tr":"Matthias, Maththias","gloss":"Matthias","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":2},{"base":"G2819","lemma":"κλῆρος","tr":"klēros","gloss":"lot","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":11},{"base":"G5117","lemma":"τόπος","tr":"topos","gloss":"place","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":94},{"base":"G1417","lemma":"δύο","tr":"duo","gloss":"two","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":134},{"base":"G0322","lemma":"ἀναδείκνυμι","tr":"anadeiknumi","gloss":"to appoint","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":2},{"base":"G0923","lemma":"Βαρσαβᾶς","tr":"Barsabas","gloss":"Barsabbas","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":2},{"base":"G2589","lemma":"καρδιογνώστης","tr":"kardiognōstēs","gloss":"heart-knower","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":2},{"base":"G2459","lemma":"Ἰοῦστος","tr":"Ioustos","gloss":"Justus","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":3},{"base":"G3845","lemma":"παραβαίνω","tr":"parabainō","gloss":"to transgress","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":3},{"base":"G0651","lemma":"ἀποστολή","tr":"apostolē","gloss":"apostleship","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":4}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"1SA","chapter":16,"verse":7,"verseEnd":7,"votes":7,"source":"both","text":"But the LORD said to Samuel, “Do not consider his appearance or height, for I have rejected him; the LORD does not see as man does. For man sees the outward appearance, but the LORD sees the heart.”","from":24},{"book":"LEV","chapter":16,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"After Aaron casts lots for the two goats, one for the LORD and the other for the scapegoat,","from":26},{"book":"ACT","chapter":15,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"And God, who knows the heart, showed His approval by giving the Holy Spirit to them, just as He did to us.","from":24},{"book":"JER","chapter":17,"verse":10,"verseEnd":10,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"I, the LORD, search the heart; I examine the mind to reward a man according to his way, by what his deeds deserve.","from":24},{"book":"NUM","chapter":27,"verse":16,"verseEnd":16,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"“May the LORD, the God of the spirits of all flesh, appoint a man over the congregation","from":24},{"book":"JOS","chapter":18,"verse":10,"verseEnd":10,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And Joshua cast lots for them in the presence of the LORD at Shiloh, where he distributed the land to the Israelites according to their divisions.","from":26},{"book":"1SA","chapter":14,"verse":41,"verseEnd":42,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"So Saul said to the LORD, the God of Israel, “Why have You not answered Your servant this day? If the fault is with me or my son Jonathan, respond with Urim; but if the fault is with the men of Israel, respond with Thummim.” And Jonathan and Saul were selected, but the people were cleared of the charge. Then Saul said, “Cast the lot between me and my son Jonathan.” And Jonathan was selected.","from":26},{"book":"1KI","chapter":8,"verse":39,"verseEnd":39,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"be heard by You from heaven, Your dwelling place. And may You forgive and act, and repay each man according to all his ways, since You know his heart—for You alone know the hearts of all men—","from":24}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"the-twelve","title":"The Twelve Apostles","people":2}]}}